[agent] ### Step 3: Create a Job to Engineer Features and Insert into Feature Group
[agent] I will create a job to:
[agent] 1. Load the raw data from `/Resources/airquality_history.csv`.
[agent] 2. Compute the engineered features (`pm25_lag2`, `pm25_lag3`, `pm25_rolling_3d`, `pm25_rolling_7d`, `temp_humidity_interaction`).
[agent] 3. Insert the enriched data into the feature group `airq2408fa`.
[agent:write] ?
[agent:result] path: /Users/wolffbe/workspace/banter/testbed/results/2_hw-full-cli-sdk-skills-mistral-large/mistral-large-3/hopsworks/cli/5.1+alerting/official/capstone/airquality/1/task/feature_engineering_job.py
[agent:result] bytes_written: 1020
[agent:result] content: #!/usr/bin/env python3
[agent:result] """
[agent:result] Job to engineer features and insert into feature group `airq2408fa`.
[agent:result] """
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] import hopsworks
[agent:result] import pandas as pd
[agent:result] import numpy as np
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] # Connect to Hopsworks
[agent:result] project = hopsworks.login()
[agent:result] fs = project.get_feature_store()
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] # Load raw data
[agent:result] raw_df = pd.read_csv("/Resources/airquality_history.csv", parse_dates=["date"])
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] # Sort by date
[agent:result] raw_df = raw_df.sort_values("date").reset_index(drop=True)
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] # Lag features
[agent:result] raw_df["pm25_lag2"] = raw_df["pm25"].shift(2)
[agent:result] raw_df["pm25_lag3"] = raw_df["pm25"].shift(3)
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] # Rolling features
[agent:result] raw_df["pm25_rolling_3d"] = raw_df["pm25"].rolling(3, min_periods=1).mean()
[agent:result] raw_df["pm25_rolling_7d"] = raw_df["pm25"].rolling(7, min_periods=1).mean()
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] # Interaction feature
[agent:result] raw_df["temp_humidity_interaction"] = raw_df["temperature"] * raw_df["humidity"]
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] # Drop rows with NaN (due to lags)
[agent:result] enriched_df = raw_df.dropna()
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] # Get feature group
[agent:result] fg = fs.get_feature_group("airq2408fa", version=1)
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] # Insert enriched data
[agent:result] fg.insert(enriched_df, write_options={"wait_for_job": True})
